  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1253141,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## +60K Burst Backup: A Commodore 64 Bubble-Busting Adventure!\n\nDive into the sudsy chaos of +60K Burst Backup, a frantic and colorful one or two-player educational game for the Commodore 64! Step into Soapie's bathtub, a bubbly paradise under siege by the mischievous Zeboingers – bird-like creatures determined to pop every last bubble. \n\nAs the player, you control a targeting device, tasked with launching bubbles to intercept the Zeboingers before they reach the bath. But beware! Your bubble juice supply is limited, forcing you to strategize and prioritize your shots. The Zeboingers aren't defenseless either; they can unleash havoc by opening windows or activating the shower, further depleting the bubbly defenses. \n\nChoose your challenge: begin at round 1 for a gentle introduction or jump straight into the action at round 11 for a truly intense experience. With its charming graphics, catchy soundtrack, and increasingly challenging gameplay, +60K Burst Backup offers a delightful and addictive experience for players of all ages. Can you save Soapie's bath from total Zeboinger destruction?"
    },
